  "notes": "Records hold no charge faster than 0.3C, no temperature other than about 26.7 degC and no plating measurement. Each file repeats two Test Time values (inside step 8, and the final single-row step 24), so a parser that requires strictly increasing time must drop exact repeats. Current is a magnitude: the Md column, not imported here, marks charge (C), discharge (D) and rest (R). The chamber dips to about 12.5 degC during some rests. Fetch the files with scripts/fetch_lgm50_data.py (sha256 pinned)."
